# Chart colour

A chart colour identifies a source or device. It must not change because another source was added, a series was hidden or the brand palette changed. **Vivid and Muted follow the theme's existing colour toggle.** Light and Dark remain separate display modes.

The [machine-readable contract](../reference/chart-colours.json) and repository module `design-system/chart-colours.mjs` are the shared authority for the theme, native Energy adapter and [working examples](../components/chart-examples.html). Do not define another palette inside a chart or demonstration.


## Apply brand data guidance

The [brand data chapter](brand-data.html) sets the editorial rules for communicating a result, comparison or uncertainty. The deterministic series colours on this page and the [maintained Energy chart specification](../components/charts.html) remain the operational contract.


